     "file": "gekr115",
     "pages": 14,
     "head": "कलाानांा� प्रवरं� चि�त्रं� धर्ममकार्मार्थम र्मोक्षदर्म्। र्मङ्गल्यं� परंर्म� हयेेतद् गृहे येत्रं प्रतितष्ठि�तर्म्॥ kalānāṁ pravaraṁ chitraṁ dharmakāmārtha mokṣhadam ǀ māṅgalyaṁ parmaṁ hyetada gr̥ ihe yatra pratiṣhṭhitam ǁ Among the arts, painting is the foremost; it bestows dharma, artha, kama, and moksha. Wherever it is established, it brings auspiciousness. — Chitrasutra from Vishnudharmottara Purana, Ch: 43 shloka 38 15_Visual Arts.indd 15215_Visual Arts.indd 152 25-04-2025 14:27:4925-04-2025 14:27:49 Reprint 2026-27"
